      "en": "Then I asked, “Where are you going?” He said to me, “To measure Jerusalem, to see what is its width and what is its length.”",
      "ko": "네가 어디로 가느냐 물은즉 내게 대답하되 예루살렘을 척량하여 그 장광을 보고자 하노라 할 때에",
      "source_text_hash": "7ef53585b16a3756fba729462891314c45f4c3f045a4deace7a6b586fc02ba45",
      "translation_text_hash": "4ecf5cb2928512296b685cc4f08d46793114ae02cfbabeb38cc05cde64b3532c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
