      "en": "Behold, the angel who talked with me went out, and another angel went out to meet him,",
      "ko": "내게 말하는 천사가 나가매 다른 천사가 나와서 그를 맞으며",
      "source_text_hash": "8e237d678b59470edcf533856708eb9d206dbdc1a972aac62ff4f35b40cc99c7",
      "translation_text_hash": "b6661862744ab0d0852c52669c5a11852ad1a8254dcca43fcb83abf582c992aa",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
